  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1740516714_2580072_55163e3367e35b54b3229b38f90cb782.jpg",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull;<strong> Brand introduction</strong>:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We're Davies Reid!&nbsp; A high-end rug &amp; art store located in Sun Valley, ID.&nbsp; For 40+ years, we've been designing and manufacturing organic, handmade rugs made by Turkmen refugees that have been weaving rugs for generations.&nbsp; Our business helps support the livelihoods of the Turkmen people as well as support our foundation, Yurts to Universities, which educates girls &amp; women in Afghanistan.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; <strong>Product description</strong>:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our rugs are handmade from high mountain, handspun wool and organic vegetable dyes.&nbsp; They are as organic and high-quality as rugs come.&nbsp; Dense and full of texture.&nbsp; Hand woven by Turkmen weavers in their homes which allows for a healthy work environment for our weavers.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We also sell rare Asian artifacts from all over the middle east.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our rugs are eco-friendly... chemicals never touch our rugs, will last multiple lifetimes, easy to clean, and support a good cause.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Opportunity For BIG PAYDAY</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our high quality rugs come with a big price tag... which mean 10% goes a long way.&nbsp; For example, our 9x12 rugs range from $10,000 - $15,000... thats $1000-$1500 for you on a single sale!</p>",
